# {{lb|en|set theory}} The {{l|en|cardinality}} of the smallest {{l|en|nonempty}} set.
# {{lb|en|mathematics}} The {{l|en|ordinality}} of an element which has no {{l|en|predecessor}}, usually called ''{{l|en|first}}'' or ''{{l|en|number one}}''.

