===Etymology 2===
{{etymid|en|particle}}
Analogous to several senses of {{sl|en|nan-hbl|ê|notext=1}} and {{sl|en|cmn|的|tr=de|notext=1|pos=declarative particle, [[nominalizer]], etc.|nocat=1}}. This [[Appendix:Glossary#semantic_loan|semantic loan]] might have stemmed from the apparent similarity between ''one'' as a [[pro-form|prop-word]] and {{m|cmn|的}}/{{m|nan-hbl|ê|-ê}} as a nominalizer (e.g. {{m|nan-hbl|[[青色]][[的]]|t=the green one}}). Compare {{ncog|yue|嘅|tr=ge<sup>3</sup>}}.

